1
Using synthetic assumptions only, triage a reported storm-damage claim involving a roof, internal ceiling water damage, and a fence. List evidence required, possible coverage questions, vulnerability and fair-treatment considerations, and reasons an authorised claims manager must decide the next step. Do not decide coverage or allege fraud.
